window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1087\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωγή</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino de ἄγω. I. Transporte, carregamento, frete, movimento, condução a algum lugar, captura e rapto; também aqueduto, carga e peso. II. Manobras técnicas: acio</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1088\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωγικά</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro plural: despesas de transporte, custos de carregamento ou frete; Código Justiniano 10.30.4.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1089\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγώγιμος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Transportável, que pode ser levado, mercadorias e pertences. II. De pessoa ou coisa, sujeita a captura ou apreensão legal. III. Fácil de conduzir, maleável. I</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1090\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγώγιον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro: carga de carroça, volume transportado por veículo; por extensão, transporte desse carregamento; Xenofonte e papiros.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1091\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωγός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -όν e substantivo: guia, condutor, escolta; que conduz a um lugar ou finalidade. Também aqueduto; força atrativa como de ímã; que faz brotar ou extrair lágrimas, secr</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1092\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωίλιον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ἀωίλιον, termo documentado em papiros PSI 4.423.6; conservar a remissão, pois a fonte não define sentido próprio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1093\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγών</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῶνος. I. Ajuntamento, assembleia, particularmente público reunido para competições; arena, espaço de prova e jogos pan-helênicos. II. Concurso</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1094\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνάρχης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: juiz, árbitro ou presidente de competição; na Beócia, magistrado do conselho ou da assembleia; Sófocles, inscrição de Téspias.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1095\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino. I. Competição, luta pela vitória e exercício atlético; Heródoto, Píndaro, Platão. II. Aflição mental, ansiedade, angústia, temor de resultado incerto; De</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1096\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνιάτης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: pessoa ansiosa, inquieta ou nervosa; Diógenes Laércio 2.131.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1097\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνιάω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: disputar intensamente, lutar por vitória; também estar preocupado, inquietar-se, afligir-se, padecer ansiedade, com περί, ἐπί, acusativo ou oração subordinada; Platão, </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1098\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνίζομαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo médio, com formas passivas. I. Competir em jogos e disputar prêmios; combater na guerra ou lutar pela liberdade. II. Concorrer em concursos dramáticos, música ou teatro,</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1099\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνικός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ή, -όν: leitura alternativa de ἀγωνιστικός, «próprio de competição»; Dionísio de Halicarnasso, Retórica 6.6.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1100\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγώνιος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo homógrafo A -ον. I. Pertencente ao concurso, a seu prêmio ou vitória. II. Epíteto de Hermes e Zeus como protetores ou árbitros de jogos. III. Deuses de assembleia ou </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1101\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγώνιος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo homógrafo B -ον, com ἀ- privativo e γωνία: sem ângulos, não angular, de forma circular; Aristóteles, Metafísica 1020a35.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1102\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγώνισις</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: ato de competir por um prêmio, participação em competição; Tucídides 5.50.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1103\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγώνισμα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro. I. Competição, conflito, ações de batalha, façanha atlética ou equestre. II. Realização digna de prêmio, conquista, resultado de disputa; objetivo de esfor</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1104\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνισμός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: rivalidade, competição, emulação; Tucídides 7.70.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1105\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνιστέον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma verbal impessoal: é preciso competir, deve-se lutar ou empenhar-se; Xenofonte, Demóstenes.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1106\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνιστήριος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -α, -ον: apropriado ao certame ou à disputa; de equipamento de competição; neutro substantivado ἀγωνιστήριον: local de reunião ou arena; Aristides.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1107\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνιστής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino. I. Lutador, concorrente em jogos, competidor. II. Debatedor ou defensor de causa judicial. III. Ator teatral. IV. Mestre ou perito em arte ou ciência. V</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1108\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνιστικός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Próprio de concurso, apto a competir, combatente. II. Estilo retórico adequado à disputa, argumentação competitiva ou eloquente. III. Expressivo, impressi</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1109\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνοδίκης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: juiz ou árbitro de disputa, aquele que decide competição; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1110\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνοθεσία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: cargo, administração e organização de jogos públicos por um ἀγωνοθέτης; inscrição IG 2.379, Plutarco e outras fontes.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1111\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγωνοθετέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo. I. Organizar, oferecer ou presidir jogos e competições, incluindo jogos píticos e olímpicos. II. Em sentido figurado, envolver pessoas em conflito, instigar facções ou </td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n1087\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1087\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1101\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωγή\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino de ἄγω. I. Transporte, carregamento, frete, movimento, condução a algum lugar, captura e rapto; também aqueduto, carga e pes\">ἀγωγή</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino de ἄγω. I. Transporte, carregamento, frete, movimento, condução a algum lugar, captura e rapto; também aqueduto, carga e peso. II. Manobras técnicas: acionamento de máquinas, traçado de linhas, evocação de espíritos e feitiço de atração. III. Direção, orientação, comando militar, ensino, treinamento e educação, especialmente a formação pública da juventude espartana; cultivo de plantas e tratamento médico. IV. Modo de vida, conduta, observância de dias, método, estilo, demonstração lógica, escola filosófica, movimento tático e ação judicial (latim actio). V. Na música, andamento, sucessão melódica e estilo musical. As divisões e testemunhos restantes estão preservados no TEI para tradução analítica integral.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwgh/&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1087&quot; key=&quot;a)gwgh/&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγωγή&quot;&gt;ἀγωγή&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄγω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n1087.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;carrying away,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:6:85&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 6.85&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;i&gt;freight, carriage,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρὸς τὰς ἀγωγὰς . . χρῆσθαι ὑποζυγίοις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:370e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 370e&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,010:7:5&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lac.&lt;/title&gt; 7.5&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Lond.:3:948:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PLond.&lt;/title&gt; 3.948.2&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(iii A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;b&quot; id=&quot;n1087.1&quot; level=&quot;4&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; intr., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὴν ἀ. διὰ τάχους ἐποιεῖτο&lt;/foreign&gt; pursued his &lt;i&gt;voyage,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:4:29&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 4.29&lt;/bibl&gt; (v.l.); &lt;i&gt;movement,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:604b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 604b&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἐπί τι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;tendency&lt;/i&gt; towards . . , &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,006:1:1:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epid.&lt;/title&gt; 1.1&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1087.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;bringing to&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;in,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὑμῶν ἡ ἐς τοὺς ὀλίγους ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; your &lt;i&gt;bringing&lt;/i&gt; us &lt;i&gt;before&lt;/i&gt; the council, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:5:85&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 5.85&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1087.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;forcible seizure, carrying off, abduction,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:1263&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 1263&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,007:662&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OC&lt;/title&gt; 662&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγωγὴν ποιήσασθαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Tebt.:39:22&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PTeb.&lt;/title&gt; 39.22&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Tebt.:48:22&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;48.22&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;4&quot; id=&quot;n1087.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὕδατος ἀγωγαί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;i&gt;aqueducts,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 12(5).872&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Tenos&lt;/placeName&gt;), cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,001:3:67&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; 3.67&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;5&quot; id=&quot;n1087.5&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;load,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ostr.&lt;/title&gt; 1168; &lt;i&gt;weight,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;AB&lt;/title&gt; 333. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;6&quot; id=&quot;n1087.6&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;winding up&lt;/i&gt; of engine, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1599,001:57:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Bel.&lt;/title&gt; 57.13&lt;/bibl&gt; (pl.). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;7&quot; id=&quot;n1087.7&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;drawing&lt;/i&gt; of lines, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4036,011:pp. 284,376&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Procl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;in Euc.&lt;/title&gt; pp. 284,376&lt;/bibl&gt;F. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;8&quot; id=&quot;n1087.8&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;evoking,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πνευμάτων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2023,006:3:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Iamb.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Myst.&lt;/title&gt; 3.6&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (pl.). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;b&quot; id=&quot;n1087.9&quot; level=&quot;4&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;spell for bringing&lt;/i&gt; a person, usu. &lt;i&gt;love-charm,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;PMag.Par.&lt;/title&gt; 1.1390. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1087.10&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;leading, guidance,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἵππου&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,013:6:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.&lt;/title&gt; 6.4&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἡ τοῦ νόμου, τοῦ λογισμοῦ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:645a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 645a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,008:274b&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Plt.&lt;/title&gt; 274b&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1087.11&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;leading&lt;/i&gt; of an army, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:746e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 746e&lt;/bibl&gt; (pl.); &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. στραταρχίας&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;conduct&lt;/i&gt; of an expedition, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1764,001:339:29&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Vett.Val.&lt;/author&gt; 339.29&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἡ ἀ. τῶν πραγμάτων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:3:8:5&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 3.8.5&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1087.12&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;direction, training,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;παιδεία μέν ἐσθʼ ἡ παίδων ὁλκή τε καὶ ἀ. πρὸς τὸν ὑπὸ τοῦ νόμου λόγον ὀρθὸν εἰρημένον&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:659d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 659d&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:819a&quot;&gt;819a&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ὀρθῆς τυχεῖν πρὸς ἀρετήν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,010:1179b:31&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;EN&lt;/title&gt; 1179b31&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;διὰ τὸ ἦθος καὶ τὴν ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,035:1292b:14&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pol.&lt;/title&gt; 1292b14&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1269,001:1:107&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Cleanth.Stoic.&lt;/author&gt; 1.107&lt;/bibl&gt;: in pl., &lt;i&gt;systems of education,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1264,001:3:173&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Chrysipp.Stoic.&lt;/author&gt; 3.173&lt;/bibl&gt;; esp. of the public education of the Spartan youth, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Λακωνικὴ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:1:32:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 1.32.1&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἀγησίλαος ἤχθη τὴν λεγομένην ἀγωγὴν ἐν Λακεδαίμονι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,044:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ages.&lt;/title&gt; 1&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. στοιχειώδης&lt;/foreign&gt; elementary &lt;i&gt;course,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0550,001:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Apollon.Perg.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Con.&lt;/title&gt; 1&lt;/bibl&gt; Praef.:—also of plants, &lt;i&gt;culture,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0093,001:1:3:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HP&lt;/title&gt; 1.3.2&lt;/bibl&gt;; of diseases, &lt;i&gt;treatment,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 12.414, 15.436. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;4&quot; id=&quot;n1087.13&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;way&lt;/i&gt; of life, &lt;i&gt;conduct,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Archyt.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;author&gt;Stob.&lt;/author&gt; 2.31.120 (pl.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Tebt.:24:57&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PTeb.&lt;/title&gt; 24.57&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;, &lt;title&gt;OGI&lt;/title&gt; 223.15 (&lt;placeName&gt;Erythrae&lt;/placeName&gt;, &lt;date&gt;iii B. C.&lt;/date&gt;), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,024:6:8&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;2 Ma.&lt;/title&gt; 6.8&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,016:3:10&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;2 Ep.Tim.&lt;/title&gt; 3.10&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0562,001:1:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;M.Ant.&lt;/author&gt; 1.6&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;5&quot; id=&quot;n1087.14&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;keeping, observance,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἡμερῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0088,002:2:37&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aristox.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rhyth.&lt;/title&gt; 2.37&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μηνῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1383,001:8:48&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Gem.&lt;/author&gt; 8.48&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;6&quot; id=&quot;n1087.15&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; generally, &lt;i&gt;method, construction&lt;/i&gt; (of a law), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1375b:12&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1375b12&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;style,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,004:20&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Isoc.&lt;/title&gt; 20&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἡ ἀ. τῶν διαλέκτων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0099,001:14:1:41&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Str.&lt;/author&gt; 14.1.41&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;7&quot; id=&quot;n1087.16&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;method of proof,&lt;/i&gt; esp. of syllogistic reasoning, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;λόγοι τὰς ἀγωγὰς ὑγιεῖς ἔχοντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1264,001:2:84&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Chrysipp.Stoic.&lt;/author&gt; 2.84&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4013,004:759:14&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Simp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;in Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 759.14&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;line of argument,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,076:106:b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cons.Apoll.&lt;/title&gt; 2.106b&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;8&quot; id=&quot;n1087.17&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;school&lt;/i&gt; of philosophers, &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sto.Herc.&lt;/title&gt; 339.12, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1595,602:p.68&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Acad.Ind.&lt;/title&gt; p.68&lt;/bibl&gt; M., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0544,001:1:145&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 1.145&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;9&quot; id=&quot;n1087.18&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; Milit., &lt;i&gt;manoeuvre, movement,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0556,001:12:7&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ascl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tact.&lt;/title&gt; 12.7&lt;/bibl&gt; and 10; &lt;i&gt;order of march,&lt;/i&gt; ib. 11.8, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0546,001:39:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ael.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tact.&lt;/title&gt; 39.1&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;10&quot; id=&quot;n1087.19&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; in Law, = Lat. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;lat&quot;&gt;actio,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cod.Just.&lt;/title&gt; 4.24.1, al. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1087.20&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;tempo,&lt;/i&gt; in music, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:400c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 400c&lt;/bibl&gt; (pl.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0088,001:p.34&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aristox.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Harm.&lt;/title&gt; p.34&lt;/bibl&gt; M., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2054,001:1:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aristid.Quint.&lt;/author&gt; 1.19&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;sequence,&lt;/i&gt; of a melody, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0088,001:p.29&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aristox.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Harm.&lt;/title&gt; p.29&lt;/bibl&gt; M.; musical &lt;i&gt;style,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0099,001:14:1:41&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Str.&lt;/author&gt; 14.1.41&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0094,002:1141:c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mus.&lt;/title&gt; 2.1141c&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1088\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1088\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1102\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωγικά\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro plural: despesas de transporte, custos de carregamento ou frete; Código Justiniano 10.30.4.\">ἀγωγικά</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro plural: despesas de transporte, custos de carregamento ou frete; Código Justiniano 10.30.4.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwgika/&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1088&quot; key=&quot;a)gwgika/&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγωγικά&quot;&gt;ἀγωγικά&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τά&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1088.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;expenses of transport,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cod.Just.&lt;/title&gt; 10.30.4.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1089\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1089\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1103\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγώγιμος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Transportável, que pode ser levado, mercadorias e pertences. II. De pessoa ou coisa, sujeita a captura ou apreensão legal. III. \">ἀγώγιμος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον. I. Transportável, que pode ser levado, mercadorias e pertences. II. De pessoa ou coisa, sujeita a captura ou apreensão legal. III. Fácil de conduzir, maleável. IV. Neutro substantivado ἀγώγιμον: filtro ou encantamento de atração amorosa; papiros mágicos e Plutarco.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gw/gimos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1089&quot; key=&quot;a)gw/gimos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγώγιμος&quot;&gt;ἀγώγιμος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, of things, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1089.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;capable of being carried,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τρισσῶν ἁμαξῶν . . ἀ. βάρος&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;enough to load,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,001:385&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyc.&lt;/title&gt; 385&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὰ ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;things portable, wares,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,022:313c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Prt.&lt;/title&gt; 313c&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,006:5:1:16&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;An.&lt;/title&gt; 5.1.16&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄλλο δὲ μηδὲν ἀ. ἄγεσθαι ἐν τῷ πλοίῳ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,035:20&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 35.20&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1089.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of persons, &lt;i&gt;liable to seizure,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,001:7:3:11&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HG&lt;/title&gt; 7.3.11&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,023:11&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 23.11&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,007:13&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sol.&lt;/title&gt; 13&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,BGU:1116:27&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;BGU&lt;/title&gt; 1116.27&lt;/bibl&gt; (13 B.C.):—also of things, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,001:5:69&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; 5.69&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1089.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;easily led, pliable,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,015:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Alc.&lt;/title&gt; 6&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1089.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Act.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;orth lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγώγιμον&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;i&gt;love-charm, philtre,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,139:1093:d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Suav.&lt;/title&gt; 2.1093d&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;title&gt;PMag.Lond.&lt;/title&gt; 121.295: pl., &lt;title&gt;PMag.Par.&lt;/title&gt; 1.2231.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1090\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1090\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1104\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγώγιον\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro: carga de carroça, volume transportado por veículo; por extensão, transporte desse carregamento; Xenofonte e papiros.\">ἀγώγιον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro: carga de carroça, volume transportado por veículo; por extensão, transporte desse carregamento; Xenofonte e papiros.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gw/gion&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1090&quot; key=&quot;a)gw/gion&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγώγιον&quot;&gt;ἀγώγιον&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1090.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;load of a wagon,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:6:1:54&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 6.1.54&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Petr.:3p.101&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PPetr.&lt;/title&gt; 3 p.101&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(iii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Lond.:3:1166:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PLond.&lt;/title&gt; 3.1166.13&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(i A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1090.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;carriage&lt;/i&gt; of such a load, &lt;title&gt;PPetr.&lt;/title&gt; l.c.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1091\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1091\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1105\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωγός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -όν e substantivo: guia, condutor, escolta; que conduz a um lugar ou finalidade. Também aqueduto; força atrativa como de ímã; que faz br\">ἀγωγός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -όν e substantivo: guia, condutor, escolta; que conduz a um lugar ou finalidade. Também aqueduto; força atrativa como de ímã; que faz brotar ou extrair lágrimas, secreções e menstruação; atrativo, encanto; Heródoto, Plutarco, Dioscórides.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwgo/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1091&quot; key=&quot;a)gwgo/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγωγός&quot;&gt;ἀγωγός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1091.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;leading, guiding,&lt;/i&gt; and as &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Subst.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;i&gt;guide,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:3:26&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 3.26&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;escort,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:2:12&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 2.12&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:4:78&quot;&gt;4.78&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ὕδατος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;i&gt;aqueduct,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mon.Anc.Gr.&lt;/title&gt; 19.5&lt;/cit&gt; (pl.); without &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὕδατος,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2734,013:128:16&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Just.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Nov.&lt;/title&gt; 128.16&lt;/bibl&gt; (pl.): c. gen., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δύναμις ἀνθρώπων ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; power &lt;i&gt;of leading&lt;/i&gt; men, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,004:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lyc.&lt;/title&gt; 5&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1091.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;leading towards,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπί τι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:525a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 525a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;D.&lt;/title&gt; 3.12; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰς&lt;/foreign&gt; . . &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,012:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Per.&lt;/title&gt; 1&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1091.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;drawing, attracting,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δύναμις ἀ. τινος,&lt;/foreign&gt; of the magnet, &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 5.130. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1091.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;drawing forth, eliciting,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;χοαὶ νεκρῶν ἀγωγοί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,007:536&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hec.&lt;/title&gt; 536&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δακρύων ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,011:1131&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 1131&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γυναικείων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,012:5:28&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aph.&lt;/title&gt; 5.28&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐμμήνων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 1.16&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1091.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; abs., &lt;i&gt;attractive,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,039:7&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Crass.&lt;/title&gt; 7&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸ ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;attractiveness,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,068:25:b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aud.poet.&lt;/title&gt; 2.25b&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1092\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1092\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1106\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωίλιον\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ἀωίλιον, termo documentado em papiros PSI 4.423.6; conservar a remissão, pois a fonte não define sentido própri\">ἀγωίλιον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ἀωίλιον, termo documentado em papiros PSI 4.423.6; conservar a remissão, pois a fonte não define sentido próprio.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwi/lion&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1092&quot; key=&quot;a)gwi/lion&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγωίλιον&quot;&gt;ἀγωίλιον&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1092.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀωίλιον, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,PSI:4:423:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PSI&lt;/title&gt; 4.423.6&lt;/bibl&gt;, al. &lt;date&gt;(iii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1093\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1093\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1107\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγών\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῶνος. I. Ajuntamento, assembleia, particularmente público reunido para competições; arena, espaço de prova e jog\">ἀγών</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῶνος. I. Ajuntamento, assembleia, particularmente público reunido para competições; arena, espaço de prova e jogos pan-helênicos. II. Concurso por prêmio, competição atlética, hípica, musical ou cênica; evento e seu certame. III. Combate, luta, esforço, disputa militar, jurídica, retórica ou moral; batalha decisiva, risco pela vida. IV. Em contexto forense, processo, causa ou defesa. O artigo registra extensa fraseologia, variedades dialetais e metáforas; texto original integral preservado.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gw/n&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1093&quot; key=&quot;a)gw/n&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγών&quot;&gt;ἀγών&lt;/head&gt; [&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾰ&lt;/foreign&gt;], &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ῶνος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Aeol.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄγωνος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0383,001:121&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Alc.&lt;/author&gt; 121&lt;/bibl&gt; (also &lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; ap. Sch.Il. &lt;title&gt;Oxy.&lt;/title&gt; 1087.60); Elean dat. pl. &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγώνοιρ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;GDI&lt;/title&gt; 1172.26&lt;/cit&gt;: (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἄγω&lt;/etym&gt;):—&lt;sense id=&quot;n1093.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;gathering, assembly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἵζανεν εὐρὺν ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23:258&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 23.258&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;λῦτο δʼ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:24:1&quot;&gt;24.1&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:8:200&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 8.200&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;νεῶν ἐν ἀγῶνι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:15:428&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 15.428&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4083,001:1335:57&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Eust.&lt;/author&gt; 1335.57&lt;/bibl&gt;: esp. &lt;i&gt;assembly met to see games,&lt;/i&gt; freq. in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 23&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ὑπερβορέων ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:10:30&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 10.30&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κοινοὺς ἀ. θέντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:845&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 845&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1093.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;place of contest, lists, course,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;βήτην ἐς μέσσον ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23:685&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 23.685&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23:531&quot;&gt;531&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:8:260&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 8.260&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,003:312&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sc.&lt;/title&gt; 312&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:9:114&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 9.114&lt;/bibl&gt;, and esp. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:5:50&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 5.50&lt;/bibl&gt;: prov., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔξω ἀγῶνος&lt;/foreign&gt; out of the &lt;i&gt;lists&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;course,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;abbr&gt;i.e.&lt;/abbr&gt; &lt;i&gt;beside the mark,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:1:44&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 1.44&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,034:21&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Anach.&lt;/title&gt; 21&lt;/bibl&gt;: pl., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κατʼ ἀγῶνας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:8:259&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 8.259&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1093.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;assembly&lt;/i&gt; of the Greeks &lt;i&gt;at the national games,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὁ ἐν Ὀλυμπίῃ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:6:127&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 6.127&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὁ Ὀλυμπικὸς ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,011:583&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pl.&lt;/title&gt; 583&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἑλλάδος πρόσχημʼ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,005:682&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;El.&lt;/title&gt; 682&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,005:699&quot;&gt;699&lt;/bibl&gt;:— hence, &lt;i&gt;contest for a prize&lt;/i&gt; at the games, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. γυμνικός, ἱππικός, μουσικός,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:2:91&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 2.91&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:658a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 658a&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,011:1163&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pl.&lt;/title&gt; 1163&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:104&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 3.104&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἱ τῶν λαμπάδων ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,003:57:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ath.&lt;/title&gt; 57.1&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τῶν ἀνδρῶν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;contest&lt;/i&gt; in which the chorus was composed of men, opp. to &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;παίδων&lt;/foreign&gt; or &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγενείων&lt;/foreign&gt; (q.v.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,021:18&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 21.18&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. στεφανηφόρος&lt;/foreign&gt; or &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;στεφανίτης&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;contest&lt;/i&gt; where the prize is a crown, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:5:102&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 5.102&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1357a:19&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1357a19&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. χάλκεος,&lt;/foreign&gt; where it is a shield of brass, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,003:10:22&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;N.&lt;/title&gt; 10.22&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. θεματικός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 14.739&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Naples&lt;/placeName&gt;); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀργυρίτης δωρίτης&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,118:820:d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Praec.&lt;/title&gt; 2.820d&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:—hence many phrases, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγῶνα καταστῆσαι&lt;/foreign&gt; establish &lt;i&gt;a contest,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,011:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.1&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τιθέναι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:5:8&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 5.8&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ποιεῖν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:104&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 3.104&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐ λόγων τοὺς ἀ. προθήσοντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:67&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 3.67&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;προηγόρευέ τε ἀγῶνας καὶ ἆθλα προυτίθει&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:8:2:26&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 8.2.26&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;προκαλούμενος ἑαυτὸν εἰς ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:2:3:17&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mem.&lt;/title&gt; 2.3.17&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τοὺς ἀ. νικᾶν&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:3:7:1&quot;&gt;3.7.1&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν τοῖς ἀγῶσι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,019:301&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 15.301&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; of contests in general, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰς ἀ. λόγων ἀφικέσθαι τινί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,022:335a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Prt.&lt;/title&gt; 335a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρὸς τίνʼ ἀγῶνας τιθέμεσθʼ ἀρετῆς&lt;/foreign&gt;; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,010:863&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 863&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. σοφίας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,009:883&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ra.&lt;/title&gt; 883&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1093.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; generally, &lt;i&gt;struggle,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πολλοὺς ἀ. ἐξιών,&lt;/foreign&gt; of Hercules, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:159&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 159&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ξιφηφόρος ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,006:584&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ch.&lt;/title&gt; 584&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰς ἀ. τῷδε συμπεσὼν μάχης&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:20&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 20&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, etc; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὁ Φίλιππος, πρὸς ὀν ἦν ἡμῖν ὁ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:67&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 18.67&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ποιέειν ἢ παθεῖν πρόκειται ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:11&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 7.11&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀληθείην ἀσκέειν ἀ. μέγιστος&lt;/quote&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:209&quot;&gt;209&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: pl., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πραγμάτων ἀγῶνας κεκτημένων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0537,001:21&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Epicur.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sent.&lt;/title&gt; 21&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄπορος ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,007:2&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 7.2&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὅπλων ἔκειτʼ ἀ. πέρι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,003:936&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aj.&lt;/title&gt; 936&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; and without &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περί, τῶν Ἀχιλλείων ὅπλων ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,003:1240&quot;&gt;1240&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ψυχῆς ἀ. τὸν προκείμενον πέρι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;struggle&lt;/i&gt; for life and death, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,016:847&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 847&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,015:1330&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 1330&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πολλοὺς ἀ. δραμέονται περὶ σφέων αὐτῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:8:102&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 8.102&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;λόγων γὰρ οὐ . . ἁγών, ἀλλὰ σῆς ψυχῆς πέρι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,005:1492&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;El.&lt;/title&gt; 1492&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. infr.  5. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1093.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;battle, action,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:2:89&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 2.89&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1093.5&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;action at law, trial,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0028,006:21&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Antipho&lt;/author&gt; 6.21&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc., cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,007:677&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eu.&lt;/title&gt; 677&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,007:744&quot;&gt;744&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἰς ἀγῶνα καθιστάναι ἀνθρώπους&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,002:24c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ap.&lt;/title&gt; 24c&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:494e&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 494e&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περὶ τῆς ψυχῆς εἰς ἀγῶνα καταστῆσαί τινα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,010:8:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lac.&lt;/title&gt; 8.4&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;4&quot; id=&quot;n1093.6&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;speech&lt;/i&gt; delivered in court or before an assembly or ruler, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρεσβευτικοὶ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:9:32:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 9.32.4&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τοὺς ἐπιφανεστάτους εἰρηκότος ἀ. τούς τε δικανικοὺς καὶ τοὺς δημηγορικούς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Amm.&lt;/title&gt; 1.3&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;title&gt;OGI&lt;/title&gt; 567 (&lt;placeName&gt;Attalia&lt;/placeName&gt;, &lt;date&gt;ii A.D.&lt;/date&gt;); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἐσχηματισμένοι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,016:8:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 8.1&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, al. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;b&quot; id=&quot;n1093.7&quot; level=&quot;4&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; Rhet., &lt;i&gt;main argument&lt;/i&gt; of a speech (opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;προοίμιον, ἐπίλογος&lt;/foreign&gt;), in pl., Syr.&lt;title&gt;in Hermog.&lt;/title&gt; 2.111, 170R., cf. &lt;title&gt;Proll. Hermog.&lt;/title&gt; ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0598,001:4:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Rh.&lt;/author&gt; 4.12&lt;/bibl&gt; W. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;5&quot; id=&quot;n1093.8&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; metaph., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐ λόγων ἔθʼ ἁγών&lt;/foreign&gt; now is not &lt;i&gt;the time for&lt;/i&gt; words, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,015:588&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 588&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐχ ἕδρας ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; ʼtis no &lt;i&gt;time for&lt;/i&gt; sitting still, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,016:1291&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 1291&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. πρόφασιν οὐ δέχεται&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;the crisis&lt;/i&gt; admits no dallying, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,012:331&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 331&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,005:421d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cra.&lt;/title&gt; 421d&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:751d&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 751d&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μέγας ὁ ἀ. . . τὸ χρηστὸν ἢ κακὸν γενέσθαι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;the issue&lt;/i&gt; is great . . , &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:608b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 608b&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,003:235&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Med.&lt;/title&gt; 235&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐ περί τινος ὁ ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;the question&lt;/i&gt; is not about . . , &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:44&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 3.44&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;6&quot; id=&quot;n1093.9&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;mental struggle, anxiety,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:7:71&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 7.71&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:4:56:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 4.56.4&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,012:2:1&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ep.Col.&lt;/title&gt; 2.1&lt;/bibl&gt;: in pl., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τρόμοι καὶ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,007:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sol.&lt;/title&gt; 7&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;b&quot; id=&quot;n1093.10&quot; level=&quot;4&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of speakers, &lt;i&gt;vehemence, power,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0560,001:15:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Longin.&lt;/author&gt; 15.1&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0560,001:26:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;26.3&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;IV&quot; id=&quot;n1093.11&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; personified, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἀγών,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;divinity of the contest,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0525,001:5:26:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Paus.&lt;/author&gt; 5.26.3&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1094\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1094\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1108\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνάρχης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: juiz, árbitro ou presidente de competição; na Beócia, magistrado do conselho ou da assembleia; Sófocles, inscrição de Tésp\">ἀγωνάρχης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: juiz, árbitro ou presidente de competição; na Beócia, magistrado do conselho ou da assembleia; Sófocles, inscrição de Téspias.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwna/rxhs&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1094&quot; key=&quot;a)gwna/rxhs&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-άρχης&quot;&gt;ἀγωνάρχης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1094.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;judge of a contest,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,003:572&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aj.&lt;/title&gt; 572&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1094.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; (&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγών&lt;/foreign&gt; = assembly) Boeotian magistrate, &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 7.1817 (&lt;placeName&gt;Thespiae&lt;/placeName&gt;), cf. Sch. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:24:1&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 24.1&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1095\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1095\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1109\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino. I. Competição, luta pela vitória e exercício atlético; Heródoto, Píndaro, Platão. II. Aflição mental, ansiedade, angústia, \">ἀγωνία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino. I. Competição, luta pela vitória e exercício atlético; Heródoto, Píndaro, Platão. II. Aflição mental, ansiedade, angústia, temor de resultado incerto; Demóstenes, Menandro, Aristóteles e estoicos.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwni/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1095&quot; key=&quot;a)gwni/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ία&quot;&gt;ἀγωνία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1095.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;contest, struggle for victory,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγὼν διὰ πάσης ἀγωνίης ἔχων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:2:91&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 2.91&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πολεμίων ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,007:314&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hec.&lt;/title&gt; 314&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,011:1003&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 1003&lt;/bibl&gt;; esp. in games, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,001:2:52&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;O.&lt;/title&gt; 2.52&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:5:113&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 5.113&lt;/bibl&gt;:—also in Prose, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν δημοτικῇ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:2:3:15&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 2.3.15&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἅπασαν ἀ. ἐκτεῖναι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,060:30&quot;&gt;[&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt;] 60.30&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1095.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;gymnastic exercise,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,010:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Art.&lt;/title&gt; 11&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,024:94b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Men.&lt;/title&gt; 94b&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:765c&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 765c&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.: generally, &lt;i&gt;exercise,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,023:456d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Grg.&lt;/title&gt; 456d&lt;/bibl&gt; sq., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:618b&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 618b&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1095.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of the mind, &lt;i&gt;agony, anguish,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν φόβῳ καὶ πολλῇ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:33&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 18.33&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0541,001:534:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Men.&lt;/author&gt; 534.12&lt;/bibl&gt; (pl.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:869b:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 869b6&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν τοῖς τῆς ψυχῆς φόβοις, ἐλπίσιν, ἀγωνίαις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,043:483a:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Spir.&lt;/title&gt; 483a5&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1264,001:2:248&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Chrysipp.Stoic.&lt;/author&gt; 2.248&lt;/bibl&gt;, al., &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ir.&lt;/title&gt; p. 56 W. (pl.), &lt;author&gt;Nic.Dam.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Vit.Caes.&lt;/title&gt; 9.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1096\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1096\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1110\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνιάτης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: pessoa ansiosa, inquieta ou nervosa; Diógenes Laércio 2.131.\">ἀγωνιάτης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: pessoa ansiosa, inquieta ou nervosa; Diógenes Laércio 2.131.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnia/ths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1096&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnia/ths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ιάτης&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιάτης&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾱτ&lt;/foreign&gt;], &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1096.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;nervous person,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0004,001:2:131&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.L.&lt;/author&gt; 2.131&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1097\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1097\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1111\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνιάω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: disputar intensamente, lutar por vitória; também estar preocupado, inquietar-se, afligir-se, padecer ansiedade, com περί, ἐπί, acusativo o\">ἀγωνιάω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: disputar intensamente, lutar por vitória; também estar preocupado, inquietar-se, afligir-se, padecer ansiedade, com περί, ἐπί, acusativo ou oração subordinada; Platão, Isócrates, Políbio.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnia/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1097&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnia/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ιάω&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιάω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;inf.&lt;/mood&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ιᾶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,022:333e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Prt.&lt;/title&gt; 333e&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;part.&lt;/mood&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ιῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,018:162c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Chrm.&lt;/title&gt; 162c&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,011:91&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 4.91&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;impf.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγωνίων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:1:10:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 1.10.6&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, etc.: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;fut.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-άσω [ᾱ&lt;/foreign&gt;] &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2034,003:1:54&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Porph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Abst.&lt;/title&gt; 1.54&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγωνίᾱσα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0515,001:22:5&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Timocl.&lt;/author&gt; 22.5&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1595,241:p.41&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Oec.&lt;/title&gt; p.41&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;author&gt;J.&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0060,001:14:60&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.S.&lt;/author&gt; 14.60&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pf.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγωνίᾱκα &lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὑπερ-&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,061:28&quot;&gt;[&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt;] 61.28&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;sense id=&quot;n1097.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;contend eagerly, struggle,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,021:61&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 21.61&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρὸς ἀλλήλους&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; l.c. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1097.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;to be distressed&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;anxious, be in an agony,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τετραχύνθαι τε καὶ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,022:333e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Prt.&lt;/title&gt; 333e&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιῶντα καὶ τεθορυβημένον&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,020:210e&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ly.&lt;/title&gt; 210e&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:869b:8&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 869b8&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0541,010:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Men.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Her.&lt;/title&gt; 2&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Petr.:3p.151&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PPetr.&lt;/title&gt; 3 p.151&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περί τινος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1367a:15&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1367a15&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: c. acc., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:1:20:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 1.20.6&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπί τινι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,048:46&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Caes.&lt;/title&gt; 46&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. μή&lt;/foreign&gt; . . &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:3:9:2&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 3.9.2&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. εἴ τι πείσεται&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Nic.Dam.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Vit.Caes.&lt;/title&gt; 9&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1098\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1098\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1112\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνίζομαι\" data-meanings=\"Verbo médio, com formas passivas. I. Competir em jogos e disputar prêmios; combater na guerra ou lutar pela liberdade. II. Concorrer em concursos\">ἀγωνίζομαι</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo médio, com formas passivas. I. Competir em jogos e disputar prêmios; combater na guerra ou lutar pela liberdade. II. Concorrer em concursos dramáticos, música ou teatro, atuar ou apresentar peça. III. Disputar oratoriamente, argumentar em debate, litigar e defender causa em tribunal. IV. Esforçar-se, empenhar-se, lutar por objetivo. V. Passivo: ser objeto de disputa, ser julgado em certame ou causa; Heródoto, Eurípides, Demóstenes.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwni/zomai&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1098&quot; key=&quot;a)gwni/zomai&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ίζομαι&quot;&gt;ἀγωνίζομαι&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;fut.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ῐοῦμαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,004:992&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Heracl.&lt;/title&gt; 992&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, etc. (in pass. sense, &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; infr. B); &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ίσομαι&lt;/foreign&gt; only in late writers, as &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2034,003:1:31&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Porph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Abst.&lt;/title&gt; 1.31&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ισθήσομαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Aristid.&lt;/author&gt; 1.504J.&lt;/cit&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγωνισάμην&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,008:427&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 427&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, etc.: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pf.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγώνισμαι&lt;/foreign&gt; (in act. sense) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,010:939&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 939&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,004:993&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;V.&lt;/title&gt; 993&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,002:31&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 18.31&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; infr. B): &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγωνίσθην&lt;/foreign&gt; in pass. sense, infr. B: act. form &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγωνίσας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 4.429&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Sicyon&lt;/placeName&gt;):— &lt;sense n=&quot;A&quot; id=&quot;n1098.1&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;contend for a prize,&lt;/i&gt; esp. in the public games, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:2:160&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 2.160&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρός τινα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:579c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 579c&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, al.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περί τινος&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;about&lt;/i&gt; a thing, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:8:26&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 8.26&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ὀλυμπίασιν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,026:364a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hp.Mi.&lt;/title&gt; 364a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περὶ πρωτείων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:66&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 18.66&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὑπὲρ τῆς ἐλευθερίας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:177&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 18.177&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: freq. c. acc. cogn., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. στάδιον&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:5:22&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 5.22&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τῶν ἀγώνων, οὓς περὶ τῆς ψυχῆς ἠγωνίζεσθε&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:262&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 18.262&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγῶνα . . τόνδʼ ἠγωνίσω&lt;/foreign&gt; thou &lt;i&gt;didst provoke&lt;/i&gt; this contest, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,008:427&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 427&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,010:939&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 939&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγωνίζου τι ἡμῖν&lt;/quote&gt; ; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,027:530a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 530a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: metaph., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὰ τῆς ψυχῆς Ὀλύμπια&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Porph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Abst.&lt;/title&gt; l.c.&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1098.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;fight,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:1:76&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 1.76&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:1:82&quot;&gt;82&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περὶ τῶν ἁπάντων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:6:16&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 6.16&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρός τινα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:1:36&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 1.36&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:8:27&quot;&gt;8.27&lt;/bibl&gt;: c. acc. cogn., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μῶν τι κεδνὸν-ίζετο&lt;/foreign&gt;; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,004:795&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Heracl.&lt;/title&gt; 795&lt;/bibl&gt;; [&lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μάχην] -ίσαντο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,008:637&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 637&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1098.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;contend for the prize on the stage,&lt;/i&gt; of the rhapsode, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:5:67&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 5.67&lt;/bibl&gt;; of the playwright, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,001:140&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ach.&lt;/title&gt; 140&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,001:419&quot;&gt;419&lt;/bibl&gt;; of the actor, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,019:246&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 19.246&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. 250, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,034:1451a:8&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Po.&lt;/title&gt; 1451a8&lt;/bibl&gt;; of the choragus, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,021:66&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 21.66&lt;/bibl&gt;: c. acc., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δράματα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 12(7).226&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;placeName&gt;Amorgos&lt;/placeName&gt;): generally, &lt;i&gt;contend for victory,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;καλῶς . . ἠγώνισαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,011:194a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Smp.&lt;/title&gt; 194a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,028:235d&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Mx.&lt;/title&gt; 235d&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;argue,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὅλῳ τῷ πράγματι&lt;/foreign&gt; about the question as a whole, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,026:369c&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Hp.Mi.&lt;/title&gt; 369c&lt;/bibl&gt;; esp. &lt;i&gt;argue sophistically,&lt;/i&gt; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;διαλέγομαι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,006:167e&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Tht.&lt;/title&gt; 167e&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;4&quot; id=&quot;n1098.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of public speaking, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:3:7:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mem.&lt;/title&gt; 3.7.4&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. πρὸς ἀπόδειξιν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,051:133&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 133&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Theodect.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0598,001:6:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Rh.&lt;/author&gt; 6.19&lt;/bibl&gt; W.). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1098.5&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;contend in court,&lt;/i&gt; as law term, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0028,005:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Antipho&lt;/author&gt; 5.7&lt;/bibl&gt;: c. acc. cogn., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. δίκην, γραφήν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;fight&lt;/i&gt; a cause &lt;i&gt;to the last,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,003:20&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 3.20&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,023:100&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 23.100&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ψευδομαρτυριῶν&lt;/foreign&gt; (sc. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γραφήν&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,024:131&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 24.131&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἀγῶνα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0027,001:20&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;And.&lt;/author&gt; 1.20&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 7,39; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ, φόνον&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;fight against&lt;/i&gt; a charge of murder, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,006:336&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Andr.&lt;/title&gt; 336&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;αὐτοῖς ἀ. τοῖς πράγμασιν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;grapple with&lt;/i&gt; the facts of the case, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1404a:5&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1404a5&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1098.6&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; generally, &lt;i&gt;struggle, exert oneself,&lt;/i&gt; c. &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;inf.&lt;/mood&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:4:87&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 4.87&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εὖ ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,020:22&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 20.22&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,049:37&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Phoc.&lt;/title&gt; 37&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;B&quot; id=&quot;n1098.7&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;to be decided by contest, brought to issue,&lt;/i&gt; mostly in &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pf.&lt;/tns&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πολλοὶ ἀγῶνες ἀγωνίδαται&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:9:26&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 9.26&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὰ ἠγωνισμένα&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;points at issue,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,008:465&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 465&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,024:145&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 24.145&lt;/bibl&gt;: rarely in &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pres.&lt;/tns&gt;, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὁ ἀγωνιζόμενος νόμος&lt;/foreign&gt; the law &lt;i&gt;on trial,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,024:28&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 24.28&lt;/bibl&gt;; or &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor.&lt;/tns&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δεινὸς . . κίνδυνος ὑπὲρ τῆς . . ἐλευθερίας ἠγωνίσθη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,002:34&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 2.34&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγωνίσθη λαμπρῶς&lt;/foreign&gt; (impers.) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,042:21&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sert.&lt;/title&gt; 21&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;fut.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Med.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; in pass. sense, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιεῖται καὶ κριθήσεται τὸ πρᾶγμα&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;shall be brought to issue&lt;/i&gt; and determined, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,021:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 21.7&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1099\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1099\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1113\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνικός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ή, -όν: leitura alternativa de ἀγωνιστικός, «próprio de competição»; Dionísio de Halicarnasso, Retórica 6.6.\">ἀγωνικός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ή, -όν: leitura alternativa de ἀγωνιστικός, «próprio de competição»; Dionísio de Halicarnasso, Retórica 6.6.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwniko/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1099&quot; key=&quot;a)gwniko/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ικός&quot;&gt;ἀγωνικός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ή&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1099.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;v.l. for ἀγωνιστικός, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,016:6:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 6.6&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1100\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1100\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1114\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγώνιος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo homógrafo A -ον. I. Pertencente ao concurso, a seu prêmio ou vitória. II. Epíteto de Hermes e Zeus como protetores ou árbitros de jogos.\">ἀγώνιος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo homógrafo A -ον. I. Pertencente ao concurso, a seu prêmio ou vitória. II. Epíteto de Hermes e Zeus como protetores ou árbitros de jogos. III. Deuses de assembleia ou presidentes das grandes competições, na expressão ἀγώνιοι θεοί. IV. Expressão ἀγωνίῳ σχολᾷ, interpretada como repouso em combate ou descanso laborioso, Sófocles.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gw/nios1&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1100&quot; key=&quot;a)gw/nios1&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγών-ιος&quot;&gt;ἀγώνιος&lt;/head&gt; (A), &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1100.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;of&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;belonging to the contest,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄεθλος ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;its&lt;/i&gt; prize, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,004:5:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;I.&lt;/title&gt; 5(4).7&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εὖχος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,001:10:63&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;O.&lt;/title&gt; 10(11).63&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πούς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0261,001:29&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Simon.&lt;/author&gt; 29&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:— epith. of Hermes as &lt;i&gt;president of games,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,004:1:60&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;I.&lt;/title&gt; 1.60&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 5(1).658; of Zeus as &lt;i&gt;decider of the contest,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:26&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 26&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. θεοί,&lt;/foreign&gt; in &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:513&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 513&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,001:189&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 189&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,001:242&quot;&gt;242&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:783a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 783a&lt;/bibl&gt;, either gods &lt;i&gt;in assembly,&lt;/i&gt; or the gods &lt;i&gt;who presided over the great games&lt;/i&gt; (Zeus, Poseidon, Apollo, and Hermes), = ἀγοραῖοι θ., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4083,001:1335:58&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Eust.&lt;/author&gt; 1335.58&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1100.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγωνίῳ σχολᾷ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,003:104&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aj.&lt;/title&gt; 104&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, either &lt;i&gt;pause from battle,&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;strenuous rest&lt;/i&gt; (oxymoron, cf. Sch.).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1101\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1101\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1115\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγώνιος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo homógrafo B -ον, com ἀ- privativo e γωνία: sem ângulos, não angular, de forma circular; Aristóteles, Metafísica 1020a35.\">ἀγώνιος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo homógrafo B -ον, com ἀ- privativo e γωνία: sem ângulos, não angular, de forma circular; Aristóteles, Metafísica 1020a35.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gw/nios2&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1101&quot; key=&quot;a)gw/nios2&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀ-γώνιος&quot;&gt;ἀγώνιος&lt;/head&gt; (B), &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1101.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;without angle,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. σχῆμα ὁ κύκλος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,025:1020a:35&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Metaph.&lt;/title&gt; 1020a35&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0093,001:3:14:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HP&lt;/title&gt; 3.14.2&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1102\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1102\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1116\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγώνισις\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: ato de competir por um prêmio, participação em competição; Tucídides 5.50.\">ἀγώνισις</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: ato de competir por um prêmio, participação em competição; Tucídides 5.50.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gw/ni^sis&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1102&quot; key=&quot;a)gw/ni^sis&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγών-ῐσις&quot;&gt;ἀγώνισις&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1102.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;a contending for a prize,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:5:50&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 5.50&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1103\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1103\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1117\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγώνισμα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro. I. Competição, conflito, ações de batalha, façanha atlética ou equestre. II. Realização digna de prêmio, conquista, resultado\">ἀγώνισμα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro. I. Competição, conflito, ações de batalha, façanha atlética ou equestre. II. Realização digna de prêmio, conquista, resultado de disputa; objetivo de esforço. III. Discurso elaborado para competição retórica ou peça teatral. IV. No direito, alegação ou fundamento apresentado em causa; Heródoto, Tucídides, Aristóteles, Antifonte.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gw/nisma&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1103&quot; key=&quot;a)gw/nisma&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγών-ισμα&quot;&gt;ἀγώνισμα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1103.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;contest, conflict&lt;/i&gt;: in pl., &lt;i&gt;deeds done in battle, brave deeds,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:8:76&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 8.76&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;feats&lt;/i&gt; of horsemanship, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,012:3:5&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.Mag.&lt;/title&gt; 3.5&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. κατὰ τὰ ἆθλα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;CIG&lt;/title&gt; 2741&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1103.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; in sg., &lt;i&gt;feat, achievement,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τινος&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;a feather in&lt;/i&gt; his &lt;i&gt;cap,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:8:12&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 8.12&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:8:17&quot;&gt;17&lt;/bibl&gt;: c. &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;inf.&lt;/mood&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:7:59&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 7.59&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:7:86&quot;&gt;86&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ξυνέσεως ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;prize&lt;/i&gt; of sagacity, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:82&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 3.82&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀρᾶς ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;issue&lt;/i&gt; of the curse, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,015:1355&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 1355&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1103.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ποιεῖσθαί τι&lt;/foreign&gt; make it &lt;i&gt;an object to strive for,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:1:140&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 1.140&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐ μικρὸν τὸ ἀ. προστάττεις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,039:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Im.&lt;/title&gt; 12&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1103.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;that with which one contends, declamation,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἐς τὸ παραχρῆμα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:1:22&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 1.22&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; of plays, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,034:1451b:37&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Po.&lt;/title&gt; 1451b37&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;IV&quot; id=&quot;n1103.4&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; in Law, &lt;i&gt;plea,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0028,005:36&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Antipho&lt;/author&gt; 5.36&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,013:77&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 13.77&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1104\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1104\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1118\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνισμός\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: rivalidade, competição, emulação; Tucídides 7.70.\">ἀγωνισμός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: rivalidade, competição, emulação; Tucídides 7.70.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnismo/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1104&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnismo/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ισμός&quot;&gt;ἀγωνισμός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1104.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;rivalry,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:7:70&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 7.70&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1105\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1105\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1119\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνιστέον\" data-meanings=\"Forma verbal impessoal: é preciso competir, deve-se lutar ou empenhar-se; Xenofonte, Demóstenes.\">ἀγωνιστέον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Forma verbal impessoal: é preciso competir, deve-se lutar ou empenhar-se; Xenofonte, Demóstenes.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwniste/on&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1105&quot; key=&quot;a)gwniste/on&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ιστέον&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιστέον&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1105.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;one must contend,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:1:6:9&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 1.6.9&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,009:70&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 9.70&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1106\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1106\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1120\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνιστήριος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -α, -ον: apropriado ao certame ou à disputa; de equipamento de competição; neutro substantivado ἀγωνιστήριον: local de reunião ou arena;\">ἀγωνιστήριος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -α, -ον: apropriado ao certame ou à disputa; de equipamento de competição; neutro substantivado ἀγωνιστήριον: local de reunião ou arena; Aristides.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnisth/rios&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1106&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnisth/rios&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ιστήριος&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιστήριος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;α&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, also &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt; (&lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0542,001:4:89&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Poll.&lt;/author&gt; 4.89&lt;/bibl&gt;), &lt;sense id=&quot;n1106.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἀγωνιστικός, κύβηλις &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0407,001:6:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Anaxipp.&lt;/author&gt; 6.6&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1106.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιστήριον&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;i&gt;place of assembly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Aristid.&lt;/author&gt; 1.108 &lt;author&gt;J.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1107\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1107\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1121\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνιστής\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino. I. Lutador, concorrente em jogos, competidor. II. Debatedor ou defensor de causa judicial. III. Ator teatral. IV. Mestre o\">ἀγωνιστής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino. I. Lutador, concorrente em jogos, competidor. II. Debatedor ou defensor de causa judicial. III. Ator teatral. IV. Mestre ou perito em arte ou ciência. V. Campeão de virtude, verdade ou outro objetivo, com genitivo; Heródoto, Platão, Isócrates.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnisth/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1107&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnisth/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ιστής&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιστής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;οῦ&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1107.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;combatant,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. πικροί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,010:1257&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 1257&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; :—esp. &lt;i&gt;competitor&lt;/i&gt; in the games, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:2:160&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 2.160&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:5:22&quot;&gt;5.22&lt;/bibl&gt;; generally, opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κριτής,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,013:13&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 2.13&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:37&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 3.37&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.:—as &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἵπποι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;race&lt;/i&gt;-horses, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,010:25&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Them.&lt;/title&gt; 25&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1107.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;pleader, debater,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,012:269d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Phdr.&lt;/title&gt; 269d&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,006:164c&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Tht.&lt;/title&gt; 164c&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1107.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;actor,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:918b:28&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 918b28&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;θεωροῖς εἴτʼ ἀγωνισταῖς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0309,001:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Achae.&lt;/author&gt; 3&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τραγικῶν παθῶν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1733,001:119&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Timae.&lt;/author&gt; 119&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1107.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;master&lt;/i&gt; in any art or science, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0010,019:201&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Isoc.&lt;/author&gt; 15.201&lt;/bibl&gt;,204; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄκρος ἀ. [τῆς γεωμετρίας&lt;/foreign&gt;] &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,061:44&quot;&gt;[&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt;] 61.44&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1107.4&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; c. gen., &lt;i&gt;one who struggles for&lt;/i&gt; a thing, &lt;i&gt;champion,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τῆς ἀρετῆς, ἀληθείας,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0026,003:180&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aeschin.&lt;/author&gt; 3.180&lt;/bibl&gt; (pl.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,068:16:c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Aud.poet.&lt;/title&gt; 2.16c&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1108\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1108\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1122\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνιστικός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Próprio de concurso, apto a competir, combatente. II. Estilo retórico adequado à disputa, argumentação competitiva ou eloque\">ἀγωνιστικός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Próprio de concurso, apto a competir, combatente. II. Estilo retórico adequado à disputa, argumentação competitiva ou eloquente. III. Expressivo, impressionante; em medicina, tratamento «heroico» ou intenso. IV. De pessoa, contencioso, inclinado a disputar. Advérbio ἀγωνιστικῶς, combativamente, ou dramaticamente em música.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnistiko/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1108&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnistiko/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγων-ιστικός&quot;&gt;ἀγωνιστικός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ή&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1108.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;fit for contest,&lt;/i&gt; esp. in the games, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;δύναμις ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1360b:22&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1360b22&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. σώματος ἀρετή&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1361b:21&quot;&gt;1361b21&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἡ -κή&lt;/foreign&gt; the art &lt;i&gt;of combat&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;contest,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,007:225a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sph.&lt;/title&gt; 225a&lt;/bibl&gt; sq.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸ ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,007:219c&quot;&gt;ib. 219c&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,007:219e&quot;&gt;219e&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1108.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;fit for contest&lt;/i&gt; in speaking, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. λέξις&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;debating&lt;/i&gt; style, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1413b:9&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1413b9&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;i&gt;contentions,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;λόγοι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,039:165b:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;SE&lt;/title&gt; 165b11&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, al.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. διατριβαί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,044:157a:23&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Top.&lt;/title&gt; 157a23&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;comp&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Comp.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ώτεραι, προτάσεις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0732,006:522:27&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Alex.Aphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;in Top.&lt;/title&gt; 522.27&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n1108.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;masterly, striking,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. προρρήματα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,010:58&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Art.&lt;/title&gt; 58&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τι ἔχουσα&lt;/foreign&gt; having in it something &lt;i&gt;glorious,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,010:70&quot;&gt;ib. 70&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πράξεις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2586,001:p.384S&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Men.Rh.&lt;/author&gt; p.384 S.&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;b&quot; id=&quot;n1108.3&quot; level=&quot;4&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; Rhet., &lt;i&gt;striking, impressive,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0560,001:23:1&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Longin.&lt;/author&gt; 23.1&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;orth lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-κόν&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0560,001:22:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; 22.3&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;comp&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Sup.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ώτατος ἑαυτοῦ,&lt;/foreign&gt; of Plato, &lt;author&gt;Them.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 34 p.448 D. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;4&quot; id=&quot;n1108.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; Medic., &lt;i&gt;‘heroic’,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;abbr&gt;i.e.&lt;/abbr&gt; &lt;i&gt;copious,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πόσεις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Philagr.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0722,001:5:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Orib.&lt;/author&gt; 5.19&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-κῶς&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Herod.&lt;/author&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0722,001:5:30:31&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;5.30.31&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 15.499; and so of &lt;i&gt;‘heroic’&lt;/i&gt; measures generally, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-κῶς θεραπεύειν&lt;/quote&gt; 18(1).61&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1108.5&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of persons, &lt;i&gt;contentious, eager for applause,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,024:75c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Men.&lt;/title&gt; 75c&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1595,241:p.65J&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Oec.&lt;/title&gt; p.65 J.&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n1108.6&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-κῶς&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;contentiously,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,044:164b:15&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Top.&lt;/title&gt; 164b15&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἔχειν&lt;/foreign&gt; to be &lt;i&gt;disposed to fight,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,033:16&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sull.&lt;/title&gt; 16&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;comp&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Comp.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπιστολὰς -ώτερον τοῦ δέοντος ἐπέστελλε&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0638,003:2:33:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Philostr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;VS&lt;/title&gt; 2.33.3&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1108.7&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;dramatically,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ᾄδειν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,036:918b:21&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 918b21&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;καταστατικῶς,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2027,001:363&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Aps.&lt;/author&gt; p.266&lt;/bibl&gt; H.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1109\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1109\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1123\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνοδίκης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: juiz ou árbitro de disputa, aquele que decide competição; Hesíquio.\">ἀγωνοδίκης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: juiz ou árbitro de disputa, aquele que decide competição; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnodi/khs&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1109&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnodi/khs&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγωνο-δίκης&quot;&gt;ἀγωνοδίκης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1109.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;judge of the contest,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1110\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1110\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1124\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνοθεσία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: cargo, administração e organização de jogos públicos por um ἀγωνοθέτης; inscrição IG 2.379, Plutarco e outras fontes.\">ἀγωνοθεσία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: cargo, administração e organização de jogos públicos por um ἀγωνοθέτης; inscrição IG 2.379, Plutarco e outras fontes.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnoqesi/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1110&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnoqesi/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγωνο-θεσία&quot;&gt;ἀγωνοθεσία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1110.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;office of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγωνοθέτης,&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;direction&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;exhibition of games,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 2.379 &lt;date&gt;(iii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0577,002:9&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nic.Dam.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Vit.Caes.&lt;/title&gt; 9&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,044:21&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ages.&lt;/title&gt; 21&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.: pl., prob. in &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 2.27 &lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n1111\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1111\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1125\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγωνοθετέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo. I. Organizar, oferecer ou presidir jogos e competições, incluindo jogos píticos e olímpicos. II. Em sentido figurado, envolver pessoas em \">ἀγωνοθετέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo. I. Organizar, oferecer ou presidir jogos e competições, incluindo jogos píticos e olímpicos. II. Em sentido figurado, envolver pessoas em conflito, instigar facções ou guerras; Plutarco, Políbio. III. Exercer a presidência dos jogos; Demóstenes, Platão.</p></section><details><summary>Original TEI integral, disponível para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gwnoqete/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n1111&quot; key=&quot;a)gwnoqete/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγωνο-θετέω&quot;&gt;ἀγωνοθετέω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n1111.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;exhibit games,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;GDI&lt;/title&gt; 1842 (Delph.), etc.; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. Πύθια, Ὀλύμπια&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:12:255&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 12.255&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Strat.&lt;/author&gt;); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μίμοις ἀ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,112:621:c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;QConv.&lt;/title&gt; 2.621c&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: metaph., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:3:38&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 3.38&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n1111.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; c. acc., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. τινάς&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;embroil&lt;/i&gt; them, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:9:343&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 9.343&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. στάσιν, πόλεμον,&lt;/foreign&gt; etc., &lt;i&gt;stir up&lt;/i&gt; faction, war, etc., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,050:45&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cat.Mi.&lt;/title&gt; 45&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0526,001:17:3:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;J.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;AJ&lt;/title&gt; 17.3.1&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n1111.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;preside at the games,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,009:32&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 9.32&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,011:184a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Smp.&lt;/title&gt; 184a&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>";
